1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,441
My best mate's a werewolf.

2
00:00:02,491 --> 00:00:03,706
So am I.

3
00:00:03,756 --> 00:00:06,107
And he's just let himself in.

4
00:00:06,337 --> 00:00:07,282
Last week,

5
00:00:07,332 --> 00:00:09,812
I found out he took his uncle's arm.

6
00:00:09,862 --> 00:00:11,692
And told me I did it.

7
00:00:12,003 --> 00:00:13,068
He didn't come at me.

8
00:00:13,118 --> 00:00:14,376
He sat down.

9
00:00:14,446 --> 00:00:15,091
He said,

10
00:00:15,141 --> 00:00:17,272
it's a full moon in an hour.

11
00:00:17,322 --> 00:00:19,231
And Mick's not here to watch us.

12
00:00:19,461 --> 00:00:21,821
Then he slid something across the table.

13
00:00:21,871 --> 00:00:23,585
A silver nail.

14
00:00:23,735 --> 00:00:24,060
Mick put one in every windowsill on this street,

15
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:27,085
he said.

16
00:00:27,135 --> 00:00:28,237
Go and look.

17
00:00:28,628 --> 00:00:29,688
Number two.

18
00:00:29,738 --> 00:00:30,878
Silver.

19
00:00:30,928 --> 00:00:31,953
Number four.

20
00:00:32,003 --> 00:00:33,089
Silver.

21
00:00:33,139 --> 00:00:34,804
Even Danny's house.

22
00:00:34,854 --> 00:00:36,072
Silver.

23
00:00:36,122 --> 00:00:37,737
His mum was at the window.

24
00:00:37,787 --> 00:00:39,459
Watching me count.

25
00:00:39,689 --> 00:00:41,906
Every house on Moor End.

26
00:00:42,056 --> 00:00:43,268
Except one.

27
00:00:43,738 --> 00:00:44,708
Mick's.

28
00:00:45,018 --> 00:00:46,778
Eight little holes in the wood.

29
00:00:46,828 --> 00:00:47,463
Fresh.

30
00:00:47,513 --> 00:00:49,021
Still splintered.

31
00:00:49,491 --> 00:00:51,647
Danny hadn't come to warn me.

32
00:00:51,757 --> 00:00:53,609
He'd come to pull them out.

33
00:00:56,559 --> 00:00:57,850
Come out.
